      "writtenOn": "2024-12-04T16:13:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed.  I\u0027d be more inclined to approve a change to remove the value from the declaration entirely, rather than updating it.  One potential issue that comes up if the default is changed: do I need to CP this to an old release branch as part of some other fix, or not?  It\u0027s easier to not have to ask the question.",
      "parentUuid": "355d531c_1f0a697c",
      "revId": "5657ab95533ada07a7724a9a788ebd2b8de02722",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
